WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hey, Doctor Jill here.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:12.000
I'm not seeing patients today, so I'm in my car running around trying to get all four of my kids ready for back to school.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
I imagine most of you are doing the same.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Despite the fact that one started school yesterday, we just weren't ready, but I'm going to get him ready today.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
I'm reaching out because as we're starting school, I'm thinking about how we re-enter from our more relaxed summer schedule and habits.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
We had the summer of our dreams, but it's time to get back to work. Work hard, play hard.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
We have played hard. It's time to work hard.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
I'm thinking about healthier snacks.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.000
I'm thinking about drinking all the right water with the electrolytes.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
I'm thinking about positive energy, and how we can embrace this year with goals.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
I'm thinking about changing air purifiers in my house, making sure the air quality is good.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.000
I'm also thinking about bedtime and sleep.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Making sure we're going to bed in enough time to restore our bodies from these beautiful lives we're living during the day.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
And that whole thing made me want to reach out to you.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:14.000
If you're getting this video from me, it's because I've met you and your sweet kiddo in the last year or so, and we've talked about their sleep-disordered breathing and how they may not be getting the rest they deserve.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.000
So I'm reaching out. Let's touch base again.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.000
How's it going?

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
I've attached to this email a sleep-disordered breathing questionnaire.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Fill it out. Let's see how your kiddo's doing.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:30.000
If you want to talk about it, or bring him in for another reevaluation, let me know and we'll get you scheduled in office.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
If it's not the right time, we're here for you when you're ready.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.000
If it is the right time, give us a call.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Let's add this into your back-to-school habits.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Let's get these kids sleeping well, breathing right, and growing the way they're supposed to.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:50.000
I hope everybody has a great school year, and if I don't see you in the office, I'm probably in my car driving carpool with these kids all over town.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.400
Thanks. Talk to you soon.
